00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:40.750
News to you?

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.250
How about Charisma, then?

00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:45.410
Charisma? Misuzu?

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:49.370
Charisma is normally a
Rare Skill used between Lilies.

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:51.040
It raises allies' morale,

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.950
and increases the whole legion's
capabilities as a result.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:58.790
Based on those properties,
it's also called a "control Skill."

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:01.750
But there are indications that Miss Misuzu

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:05.160
used it on Huge instead of Lilies.

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:08.750
There's a theory that Magie
is a will that uses Huge

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:12.410
to destroy the old order and create a new world.

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:16.540
But the Huge in our jurisdiction
have begun to display

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:20.080
behavior patterns we've never seen before.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:25.580
Like something's upsetting the Huge
and rapidly increasing their ferocity.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:30.410
The start of the change roughly
coincides with the battle we recovered this in.

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:35.750
I have to assume that something set up
two years ago got switched on then.

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.870
Does that ring any bells?

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:40.080
I don't know.

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:43.580
Misuzu was strong and kind,

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:45.830
