00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:48.700
I don't know... anything else.

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.000
I see.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.000
I'm sorry.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.620
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.410
Moyu,

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.120
I...

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:05.580
No, it's nothing.

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:16.500
I guess we can't go back
to how things were so easily.

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:20.580
Don't you think it's strange?

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:26.080
Yoshino cherries blossom so beautifully,
but they never bear fruit.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.910
They can't multiply without help from humans.

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:33.250
These are the only ones left here.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:38.120
I think the Huge are like these cherry trees.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:41.580
From the moment they're born, created by Magie,

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:44.250
they eat nothing and create nothing.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:47.000
They exist only to fight and die.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.160
