beautiful things to Huge.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:52.830
How about Lilies, then?

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:57.370
Lilies are also humans who
have become Huge due to Magie.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:11:02.040
Except Lilies fight with hesitation
and weakness in their hearts.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:05.080
The fear of possessing superhuman power,

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:12.000
and the question of whether that's
worth risking their lives to protect.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:14.250
What's the difference?

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:17.370
I don't know.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:22.370
Questioning the worth of what
we protect is above our station.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:24.370
That's correct.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:28.540
I never say things like this
to anyone else, you know?

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.330
Maybe I wanted to see that look on your face.

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:34.450
Yuyu!

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:37.330
I caught you, Yuyu.

00:11:37.330 --> 00:11:41.450
Riri. Haven't seen you since the graveyard.

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:51.290
