00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:26.830
I hereby issue an evacuation
order to all Yurigaoka students.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:32.330
All personnel are to leave their posts
and retreat to the evacuation zone.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.620
