leave her precious Schild behind.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:03.290
Stop.

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:05.540
Misuzu.

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:08.370
Miss Misuzu...

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:13.160
I knew it. Yuyu still hasn't
gotten over Miss Misuzu.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:57.870
I'll go back and look!

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:02.330
Then, I'll accompany you.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.580
I can't channel Magie?

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.080
Are you okay?!

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:09.540
Y-Yes.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:10.500
But why...?

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:13.000
I'll go on ahead!

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:31.290
This morning, I couldn't sleep.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:35.160
I watched a drop of morning dew out the window.

00:16:35.160 --> 00:16:40.040
It sparkled like a dream
when the morning sun hit it.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:45.250
Because it was so beautiful,
I tried to touch it,

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.250
and I broke it.

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:51.870
If I hadn't touched it,
I could have watched it longer.

00:16:55.040 --> 00:16:58.750
You're special to me, Yuyu.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:03.160
Only you give color to my world.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:06.250
Like that morning dew.

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:09.000
Can you tell how desperately I'm struggling

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:12.910
to hold back my wicked feelings for you?

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:17.870
The one thing I never want to do is hurt you.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.660
But

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:23.200
if I ever can't hold myself back anymore,

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:25.950
would you kill me, Yuyu?

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:27.540
What?

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:31.330
But I wouldn't mind if it were you, Misuzu.

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:36.700
Forget it, Yuyu.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.040
Misuzu?

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:39.000
I...

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:41.290
I said forget it!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:52.450
What do you think happens to
people who can't accept themselves?

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:54.950
They hate.

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:59.080
They hate themselves and everything else.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:00.410
Yes.

00:18:00.410 --> 00:18:03.950
Misuzu cursed herself.

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:05.750
Yuyu.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.500
Riri.

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:11.910
I'm here to get you, Yuyu!

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:13.080
Let's go!

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:14.750
I can't, Riri.

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:17.290
I can't go anywhere.

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:19.040
I have to stay and fight.

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:20.830
What are you talking about, Yuyu?!

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:21.620
--Let's escape together!

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.620
--Don't give me orders!
--Let's escape together!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.250
--Don't give me orders!

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:26.950
Are you going to control me
with your Rare Skill, too?!

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.250
What?

00:18:29.910 --> 00:18:33.500
I'm seeing hallucinations of Miss Misuzu.

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:37.750
I'm... broken.

00:18:37.750 --> 00:18:40.660
What do you mean?

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:44.120
Miss Misuzu cursed everything.

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.080
This is a trap.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:47.660
I have to

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:50.160
defeat those Huge.

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:59.450
You escape alone.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:01.000
Yuyu...

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:06.450
...there's no Magie in your CHARM.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.290
You can't go, Yuyu!

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:15.660
I don't care about Rare Skills or traps!

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:16.620
I want...

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:19.700
No, I <i>will </i>protect you!

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:22.540
I'll beat those Huge!

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:23.750
You can't.

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.910
You could never win against Misuzu.

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:27.660
That's not Miss Misuzu!

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:29.290
Those are Huge!

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:31.870
Wait!

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:34.750
Wait, Riri.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:40.700
I'm going, Yuyu.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.750
Why won't my CHARM work?!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:53.620
I hear other Lilies' are also nonfunctional.

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:55.200
What could...?

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:59.580
Those three Huge used
the kinetic energy of their descent

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:04.500
to burrow deep underground
and deploy a Magie barrier.

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:10.040
But interfering with Lilies' Magie
while building a body on that scale...?

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:13.620
They use Magie as if it grew on trees.

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:17.450
The first three's Magie
signatures are almost gone.

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:22.040
They seem to have been absorbed
by the newly emerged Huge.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:24.250
That Huge?

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:28.410
I can feel its animosity from here.

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:29.700
Good grief,

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:32.200
I can't use my CHARM now, of all times?

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:34.830
No one's CHARM is activating right now.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.660
We're all just as frustrated.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:40.290
Then why was only Riri able to use hers?!

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:43.290
Mayhap it concerns Riri's Rare Skill.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:44.660
Miriam.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:46.040
Her Rare Skill?

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:49.620
Charisma, a support and control Skill.

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:51.000
You knew?

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:52.790
I only guessed.

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.000
There are other Lilies with Charisma.

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:56.620
Why only Riri?

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:58.660
That's an enigma.

00:20:58.660 --> 00:21:02.870
I wonder if Riri and Miss Yuyu are all right.

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:07.370
If Riri finds out that she's the only
one who can use a CHARM right now,

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:12.250
I can imagine her running off
to take on that Huge alone.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:16.620
I'd like to think she isn't that
foolhardy, but it's conceivable.

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:19.410
She's as reckless as they come.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:22.540
I'd... like to be reckless, too.

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:23.370
Yeah.

00:21:23.370 --> 00:21:26.750
I don't want to sit here helplessly.

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:30.370
Of course. It's too soon to give up.

00:21:30.370 --> 00:21:31.540
Indeed it is!

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:34.290
We won't stand for ending up a paper tiger!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:36.660
Of course we won't!

00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:38.120
That's right.

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:40.410
That's right!

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:37.000
"To be continued"

